  "description": "Regression fixture for the fix where a single query (refId A) returns several frames. One TestData query emits three frames that all share refId A but carry different values under label sets line=A/B/C - the same shape a Prometheus query with several label sets produces. Each row of the statistics table must show its own n, Mean, Std Dev, Min, Max and Cp/Cpk/Pp/Ppk. Before the fix every row copied frame 0.",
